<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">- Gedeo Bible</book>
  <para style="h">2 Teselonqeke Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ergemallo Phawuloosixxa Langaxxa Erga Teselonqeke Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Teselonqeke Manni'a</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tes.</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ergemallo Pawuloosixxa Langaxxa Erga</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesolonqeke Manni'a</para>
  <para style="imt">E'yichchoo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kiristoosixxe langake dagixxee ke'eeki qortumi weli gonphe iyyedagemmaxxee Tesolonqexxe Mageniinxe tuuta giddo hexxexxi rakko itti lebba'ni me'ite: Pawuloosi Tesolonqeke manni'a borreessexxi langaxxi erga, «Goottinke dagixxi barra gelte'een» hitaaxxa amana duuteexxi uuddaaxxemman. Pawuloosinna Kiristoosixxe daga edo «Xaqarotik manji» hiyyemaake Kiristoosi'i moromat akeekisanjo kadeeki butta duuchcha'ni fuggoxxanna xaqaro bira saxxa'ni me'itaan hiyyati insa'nexxa amana filatee wo'lanaani.</para>
  <para style="ip">Erganji borro isixxa haasessakeera'ni rakkonna wixixxi hiyya insa'ne'ni bira saxxoolenna midde amana ifixe'ni jabaantashsha isinna wele isinni welti hujammakiir assammashshanni galduma ifikee hasissaaxxa alfatee jabaante hunjaashsha ittanni eloxxa huje hujatena'ni ga'ma'mi hinabaashsha jabeessee insa'nee gorsaan.</para>
  <para style="iot">Konne Maxaafi Giddo Hexxeexxa Yaanuwwa</para>
  <para style="io1">E'yichcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Galatakanna maganne <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoosike langake daggixxee uwwendeexxa barachcho <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 2:1-17">2:1-17</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kiristoositottixxe galdumixxee uwwemeeka gorsa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref> </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Muuxa <char style="ior"><ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref> </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nage'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Phawuloosinaa'n Sillaasinaa'ninna Ximotoosinaa'n.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="2TH 1:1" />
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Mageno no'okenna Anna'ninna Gootta no'oke Yessuusi Kiristoosi'n hexxeexxe Teseloonqeexxe amaanye'a ergemeeka nage'a.<verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Mageno Aannakenaa'ninna Gootti Yessuusi Kiristoosinaa'n badhaadhikkinna nage'i ha'no'a kadowwaal!<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kiristoosixxe Langaxxe Daga'n Uwwendaaxxa Murte</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />No'oke dayyuwwa, ha'noxxee no'o duuchchii wodda Mageno galateeffata hasissaan. Galateeffantannochchinna amana ha'noxxinna yo'oshsha nophphita'naa welinni weli eeyyunte ha'nooxxi lebba'n me'itemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Tennexxe shorremmiyyote'ninna rakko duuchcha'n ti'ni hitine uurritinemmaxxee ha'nooxxe amanaxxeenna ha'nooxxe ossuntexxee Mageniinxe tuutaari edo ha'noxxee ifi saanda'ennen.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Tenninna leellishshaak Mageniixxi murte toggittete kadaten; tennenaa'n kexxeexxa ha'no rakko adhdhitineexxe Mageniinxe mootumma'a geyaake manjo kaddinee uudendinaan. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Mageni toggitte murte muraake kadeemmaxxee ta'a ha'no'ni rakko iyyedagemmake manna'ni rakko iyyedaga'n hira insa'neeka uwwan. <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />Ta'a ha'no rakko adhdhitina'neekee no'onni welti hafuura adhdhate uwwaan. Tinni hafuura adhdhanna Gootti Yessuusi hunnaameeyye erganna ifixxinni welti iimi'ni dagaa woddan. <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Isi iimi'ni dirra qicinna bubbaaxxe giiranniten. Ookkone wodda Mageno ege'nebaaka manna Gootta no'oke Yessuusi Kirsitoossixxe wengeele'a ajajemabaaka manna'n mura ibisaan. <verse eid="2TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Insa'ne Gootti edii'ninna isike hunnaameessa ulfinnanaa'ni gargar hingeexxi duuchchii woddixxee ba'neexxi mura insa'ne'n ibbaan. <verse eid="2TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />Insa'ne'ni mura ibbaakinna eetenne barra woyyolete'n ulfaato'anna isoo amaanaake duuchcha'n saademo'a dagaaxxe barra'niten. Ha'nonna no'oxxa dhugaa kula adhdhitine amandinemmaxxee ha'nonna insa'nen welti uudendinaan.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Tenne henda'n, Mageni no'ok isike ye'inji'a ha'noo geltinaake asse uudaashsha, eloxxa hujatee afineexxa halchanna ha'nooxxe amanatenaa'n daggeexxa hanoxxa huje duuchcha isi ifixxe hunnan hano'a muuxo'a duuchchi wodda ha'nooxxee soodataannen. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Iittanni no'oke Mageno Gootti Yessuusik Kiristoosike badhaadhixxe qixxenni Gootta no'oke Yessuusi summi ha'no'ni ulfeessemo'anna ha'nonna iso'n ulfessendino'a tenne soodanta'nennen.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Kiristoos Gareeraka Manjo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Anke dayyuwwa Gootta no'oka Yessuusi Kiristoosixxe dagaxxeenna no'onna isinni welti hedhatee bukki hinannaaxxe yaanexxee hanoo kadhata'ennexxi <verse eid="2TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />Wabeekkumake'n yookaan barsiisate'ni kulendeeshsha yookaan erga no'oxxe'ni borreessendeeshsha assitineexxi, «Gootti dagaaxxi barra gelte'een» hiyyoti rakeexxi ha'noke yaadi lele'moqqe'e; daaqinoqqe'e. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Fedheeki manji ha'noo fedheeke toorinni soboqqee! Ediseexxi Mageno waakatanna Kiristoosii moromaki fuggaaleesi ba'netiki manji dagebaaki Goottinxe dagaaxxi barra geltabaan. <verse eid="2TH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Isinna, Magenoke hiyyeme ye'emaachcho yookaan magenooffatemaachcho duuchcha'n iima umo ifika lummisaake gareerallon. Isinna Mageniinke woyyichcha galma'n mare ofo'leexxi, ani Magenoken hiyyaan.<verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Ha'nonni welti hedhenne wodda tennee yaane duuchcha kuleennexxa kassi gophinaata? <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Eettene woxxendeexxe yanna'ni malee'e ta'a leellabaashsha isoo hoyya'neechchi maachcho kadeexxa egendine'een. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Iitti xaqarotixxi buqo yaane ta'anna hujate'n hexxeen; kaddo malee ta'a isee hoyya'neeke hedheen; tinni kaddaak iikki isee hoyyaak orakenaa'ni fuggussemaa qici'aaten. <verse eid="2TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Ookkonechchi uduma kunni fuggaaleesi Kiristoosiki moromalli dagaan. Yaane kinni Gootti Yessuusi dagaa wodda ifike afo'ike hafuuri callininni isoo shiyaan. <verse eid="2TH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Fuggaaleesi manji dagaaki durriissiinxe hunnanni dedhisaaka dharichcha mambe'uwwa, beessisuwwakanna maso yaanuwwa hujatiten. <verse eid="2TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />Iittanni ba'aaka manna dedhissaaxxa heene fuggoxxa yaanuwwa assatiten. Kunni manni ba'aachchinna insa'ne anjiremmaashsha assitaaxxa dhugaa eeneexxi adhdha gonpheemmaxxeeten. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Tennenaa'n kexxeexxa dharake'n amannaashsha Mageni dedhisaaxxa hunna insa'ne'n ergaan. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Tinninna iitta kaddaachchi dhugaate'ni amanemabaake yaane kinni cubbote'ni gammadamake manna duuchcha'ni murte murendaashshaten.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Anjirematee Filemeeka Manna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Koo Goottake'n eeyyendina'neeke no'oke dayyuwwaa! No'o ha'nooxxee duuchchi wodda Mageno galateeffatiyyo hasissaan. Galateefantannochchinna ha'no Woyyichchi hafuurinni woyyoyondine'e dhugaate'n amandineexxi anjirendinaashsha Mageni ha'noo edise uwwemaake umo asseexxi fi'leexxeten. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />No'o ha'no'n lallanbennexxe wengeele ga'mii'ni Mageni ha'noo ye'eechchi Gootta no'oka Yessuusi Kiristoosika ulfinna qoodendinaashshaten. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Tennexxee no'oke dayyuwwaa, ti'ni hitine uurre; afo'ikite kaddo'o borreessik no'onaa'n ha'noobaa gelteexxe barachcho jabeesitineexxi abixxe! <verse eid="2TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Umo ifikenni Gootti Yessuusi Kiristoosi no'oo eeyyeeki, badhaadha ifikenninna duuchchii woddixxa dayyeessa, eloxxa addenna no'o'aa uwweeki Mageni anni no'ok, <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />elooxxee kaddeexxa yaane duuchcha hujjinaashshanna haasotinaashsha qalbe ha'nooxxa jabeessowwaal, dayyeessowwaal.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Soodachchotixxee, Qortuma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Yoonna no'oke dayyuwwa, hiyyichchi Mageniinki ha'nobaa ba'latemmashshanni, kabanna rakeexxi ba'lataashanna ulfeesemaashsha no'aa soodattee! <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Iittanni kinni duuchchiing manni hiyyichcho laqeexxi amana gophaammaxxe'e xaqartichchanna fuggaaleesi mannanaa'ni Mageni no'oo heqqaashsha no'aa soodattee! <verse eid="2TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Gootti kinni addatemeedheeke kadeemmaxxee, isi ha'noo jabeesaan, elobaaxxenaa'ninna ha'noo heqqaan. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />No'o ha'noo ajanjeennexxa yaane ta'anna edi'anna assitinaaxxa ha'noxxee Goottake'n addanteennen. <verse eid="2TH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Gootti qalbe ha'nooxxa Mageniinxe eeyyunteba'anna Kiristoosi uwweexxe ossuntebaa akeekuun!<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Huje Hujabaake Maniinxee Uwwendeexxa Xexxe'achchiisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />No'oke dayyuwwa, no'onaa'ni baratineexxi adhdhitineexxe barrachchoxxe akeeteshshate kaddebaang huje hujja'nebaang hexxammaxxe amaangenaa'n gargar higginaashsha Gootta Yessuusi Kiristoosike summinni ha'noo ajajaannen. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Fakkeenna no'oka hordoffiyyo hasissaaxxa ha'no umo ha'nongenninni egendine'een. No'o ha'nonni welti he'nenna wodda huje belo ofoleebo'non. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Fedheeke manjixxa itanna tola indebo'non. Wele waalinni ha'noo'ni fedheeke'ninna ba'ote kandabo'noshsha hashshanna barra elo'ati hunjaannan. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Iitta assinenechchinna fakkeenna no'oka hordoffinaashsha hineete malee'e ha'nonaa'ni hasisaaka kipha alfatika seera gonphennexxeetebaan. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Ha'noonni welti he'nenna wodda «Hujo'a eeyyabaak itoqqe'e!» hiyyaaka seera ha'no'ni kulle'ennan. <verse eid="2TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Tennee iitta hineennechchi mitti mitti manni e'yishshabaaxxe yaane'ni e'yati wele manna lele'misa'ni mitteelchonna hunja'nebaang huje belo ha'nooxxe oddo'ni hedheexxa lanqeennexxeeten. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Iitta hedheek manni seerk hedha'n ifi'anni hucce itaashsha Gootta Yessuusi Kiristoosike summinni insa'nee ajanjaannen, gorsakanna insa'ne'aa uunaanneni.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ha'no kinni no'oke dayyuwwa, «Eloonneennen» hitineexxi eloxxa huje hujatenaa'ni meenni udumi'a higge. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Erga tenne'n hedheeka gorsa adhabaaka manjo hubattine affineexxi shookashsha isinni welti mittoondinnoqqe'e! <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Kaddoolenna dayyiinsha assitineexxi gorse malee'e naaphiinsha uuddinoqqe'e!<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Muuxamiinxa Nage'a Dhaama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Nage'iinki Gootti duuchchiinxe yaanenni duuchchii wodda nage'a ha'no'aa uwwowwaal! Gootti ha'noo duuchchiiggenni welti hedhowwaal! <verse eid="2TH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Nage'a konnee'e anga anixxenni ha'no'a borreessenneki ante Phawuloositen. Ani borreesseennexxe erga anxe duuchcha'ni hedheek beessisi konneten.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Gootta Yessuusi Kiristoosik badhaadhi ha'noo duuchchiiggenni welti hedhowwaal, hiyyee'e borreessaannen.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>